; Forest map redraw. New layout authored from the visual reference.
; North-to-south rows. Origin is the southwest grid boundary; units are integer millimetres.
; . two-cell main road, + circulation-only, a holding/attack candidates, B target terrain, S spawn gate.
; # closed grass/border, ~ water, ^ raised terrain without entry, * decoration.
; The eight bridge cells are road, x=17..20 and y=13..14 (zero based, y northward).
NAVGRID 1
size 44 30
cell 500
origin -11000 -7560
target 8350 -4560 1100
rows north-to-south
